A little too much defense of GMOs, but the money graf is there:



The other thing I want to avoid is the Congress preempting the states from
being able to label. Because there is a big move by all these interests to
try to make that happen. So I think if we can get the voluntary labeling,
if we can prevent the preemption, and then we can move forward. I agree
with that. I support that. It sounds like Jared does.





